  "releaseNotes": "### Breaking Changes\n* Removed .NET 8 and .NET 9 TFMs ahead of .NET 8 & 9 EOL - .NET 8 and .NET 9 remain supported via .NET Standard 2.0 TFM with limited support - Update to .NET 10 or newer for full support\n* Made ``IsWhiteSpace`` extension methods private\n* Removed additional deprecated code\n\n### Non-Breaking Changes\n* Improved helpfulness of some thrown exceptions\n* Optimisations and improvements\n* Updated internal Polyfill version to 9.13.0",
